The Lobjan Wiki (wiki.lojban.org) now has its 3-d browser feature
working.  It's really cool, but hard to explain.  Sort of a
visualization of the page connections.  You get to it (in the
default style) by clicking the tiny button that looks like a pair of
rabbit's ears (next to the tiny printer icon).

Check it out.  I don't reccomend checking it out on the main page,
though.  That takes a long time to load.

It requires Java.

